OL,3,GNEWSA'Very sad day' as consultation
OL,4,Abegins on closing one-pupil school
OL,5,
OL,6,FA consultation process has started on
OL,7,Fplans to permanently shut a tiny rural
OL,8,Fprimary school in the Borders.
OL,10,FFountainhall Primary's roll had fallen
OL,11,Ffrom 24 in 2020 to just a single pupil
OL,12,Fenrolled last summer which saw it close
OL,13,Fon a temporary basis.
OL,15,FA review found that parents of the
OL,16,Fdozen children who live in and around
OL,17,Fthe village were happy for them to go
OL,18,Fto neighbouring Heriot Primary about
OL,19,Ffive miles (8km) away.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
