OL,3,GNEWSA'Very sad day' as consultation
OL,4,Abegins on closing one-pupil school
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow the official consultation process
OL,7,Fhas started on closing the site for
OL,8,Fgood and will run until 12 October. A
OL,9,Fsenior council official called it a
OL,10,F"very sad day".
